114→ * Split a CodeBuddy Bash tool result into its sections.
115→ *
116→ * The shape is stable across both captures:
117→ *
118→ *   Command: curl -sfk -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8096/skill-bridge/v3/skill/search ...
119→ *   Stdout: {"code":0,...}
120→ *   Stderr: (empty)
121→ *   Exit Code: 0
122→ *   Signal: (none)
